  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "造型運算設計與機器學習",
    "sub_ename": "GEOMETRY FOR COMPUTATIONAL DESIGN AND MACHINE LEARNING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程目標為建立當代設計運算與新科技藝術與應用之研究與應用基礎能力，目標是將程式語言視為創作工具與媒介，使學生能運用程式進行自動化、參數化、智慧化工作，進而創造自己的數位創作流程與新工具。課程中將演算法應用於幾何編輯、設計運用與機器學習等面向之實際案例。通過本課程的學習，學生可以培養對演算法與機器學習的基本理解和興趣，並掌握一些基礎的機器學習技能，並探討其在不同領域的應用和實例，進一步完成更多跨領域實作專題。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "The goal of this course is to establish a foundation of research and applied abilities in contemporary design computation and new digital art and application. Using programming languages as creative tools and mediums, enabling students to use programming for automation, parameterization, and intelligent tasks, thereby creating their own digital creative process and new tools.This course will apply algorithms to practical cases in geometry editing, design application, and machine learning. Through this course, students can cultivate a basic understanding and interest in algorithms and machine learning, grasp some basic machine learning skills, and explore their applications and examples in different fields, further completing more interdisciplinary implementation projects.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
